| Rooms master | `docs/ROOMS.md` |
| Room types, rate plans, seasons, meals, early check-in / late checkout fees | `docs/ROOM_TYPES.md` |
| AioSell channel manager, OTA bookings, free-room and price push | `docs/AIOSELL.md` |
| Doorloom, the online calendar, or stay sync with Doorloom | `docs/DOORLOOM.md` |
| Daily room cleaning (stay-over cleaning, cleaning releases board) | `docs/DAILY_ROOM_CLEANING.md` |
| Room cleaning history | `docs/ROOM_CLEANING_HISTORY.md` |
| Laundry | `docs/LAUNDRY.md` |
| Portal notifications (header bell) | `docs/PORTAL_NOTIFICATIONS.md` |
| Portal sidebar menu search | `docs/PORTAL_MENU_SEARCH.md` |
| `db:wipe-bookings` booking data reset | `docs/BOOKING_DATA_RESET.md` |
| GRN, goods receipt, or frozen GRN cost | `docs/GRN_MODULE.md` |
| Store requisition, Main Store, or the POS stock path in the ERP SOP | `docs/PASSION_ERP_WORKFLOW_SOP.md` |
| QZ Tray install or signing | `../passion/QZ_TRAY_SETUP.md` |
| A fact stated in `PASSION_LARAVEL_ARCHITECTURE.md` (route, permission, status, owner class, JSON key, event name) | That section, in addition to the module doc |
